  "id": "opioid-withdrawal",
  "term": "opioid withdrawal",
  "definition": "Opioid withdrawal is a symptom state associated with chronic opioid use. In this packet, it is described as a condition that may be partly mediated by NMDA receptors and may also involve opioid-receptor-related mechanisms, although these mechanisms are not fully understood.",
